---
import {
  integrateSpectralDensity,
  responseModelDefaults,
  spectralDensity,
} from '../../../data/part07/responseGreenModel.mjs';

const levels = [-0.9, 0.15, 1.0];
const weights = [0.7, 1.0, 0.55];
const width = 650;
const height = 300;
const left = 58;
const right = 620;
const top = 36;
const bottom = 250;
const minEnergy = -1.8;
const maxEnergy = 1.8;
const xMap = (energy) => left + (right - left) * (energy - minEnergy) / (maxEnergy - minEnergy);
const yMap = (value) => bottom - value * (bottom - top) / 4.8;
const samplePath = (broadening) => Array.from({ length: 361 }, (_, index) => {
  const energy = minEnergy + (maxEnergy - minEnergy) * index / 360;
  return { energy, value: spectralDensity({ energy, broadening, levels, weights }) };
}).map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xMap(point.energy).toFixed(2)} ${yMap(point.value).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');
const defaultPath = samplePath(responseModelDefaults.broadening);
const defaultIntegral = integrateSpectralDensity({
  minEnergy: -8,
  maxEnergy: 8,
  intervals: 30000,
  broadening: responseModelDefaults.broadening,
  levels,
  weights,
});
const fallback = [0.04, 0.08, 0.20].map((broadening) => ({
  broadening,
  peak: spectralDensity({ energy: 0.15, broadening, levels, weights }),
  integral: integrateSpectralDensity({
    minEnergy: -8,
    maxEnergy: 8,
    intervals: 30000,
    broadening,
    levels,
    weights,
  }),
}));
---

<figure class="chapter-visual green-explorer" data-green-explorer>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：Green 函数极点、展宽与谱权重</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: Green-function poles, broadening, and spectral weight</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls green-explorer__controls">
    <label>
      <span>broadening η | 数值展宽</span>
      <input type="range" min="0.03" max="0.25" step="0.01" value={responseModelDefaults.broadening} data-green-broadening />
      <output data-green-broadening-output>{responseModelDefaults.broadening.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>probe energy E | 探测能量</span>
      <input type="range" min={minEnergy} max={maxEnergy} step="0.02" value="0.15" data-green-energy />
      <output data-green-energy-output>0.15</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-labelledby="green-title green-desc">
    <title id="green-title">Broadened spectral density of three Green-function poles</title>
    <desc id="green-desc">
      Three positive spectral weights at fixed energies produce Lorentzian peaks. A keyboard-operable broadening control changes peak width and height while the integrated spectral weight remains approximately constant over the declared finite window.
    </desc>
    <line x1={left} y1={bottom} x2={right} y2={bottom} class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1={left} y1={top} x2={left} y2={bottom} class="plot-axis" />
    {levels.map((level) => (
      <line x1={xMap(level)} y1={top} x2={xMap(level)} y2={bottom} class="green-explorer__pole" />
    ))}
    <path d={defaultPath} class="plot-curve" data-green-path />
    <line x1={xMap(0.15)} y1={top} x2={xMap(0.15)} y2={bottom} class="green-explorer__probe" data-green-probe />
    <text x={right} y="280" text-anchor="end">energy E</text>
    <text x="18" y="48">A(E)</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout green-explorer__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>A(E) | 谱密度</span>
    <strong data-green-density>{spectralDensity({ energy: 0.15, broadening: responseModelDefaults.broadening, levels, weights }).toFixed(5)}</strong>
    <span>finite-window integral | 有限窗口积分</span>
    <strong data-green-integral>{defaultIntegral.toFixed(5)}</strong>
    <span>sum of weights | 权重总和</span>
    <strong>{weights.reduce((sum, value) => sum + value, 0).toFixed(2)}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="green-explorer__fallback">
    <p><strong>无 JavaScript 参考表 | No-JavaScript reference table</strong></p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>η</th><th>A(0.15)</th><th>∫A(E)dE</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {fallback.map((entry) => (
          <tr><td>{entry.broadening.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{entry.peak.toFixed(5)}</td><td>{entry.integral.toFixed(5)}</td></tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong><code>G(z)=Σj wj/(z−εj)</code>，<code>A(E)=−ImG(E+iη)/π</code>；能级为 <code>−0.9, 0.15, 1.0</code>，权重为 <code>0.7, 1.0, 0.55</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> <code>G(z)=Σj wj/(z−εj)</code> and <code>A(E)=−ImG(E+iη)/π</code>; levels are <code>−0.9, 0.15, 1.0</code> and weights <code>0.7, 1.0, 0.55</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>所有谱密度非负；减小 <code>η</code> 使峰变窄变高；足够宽积分窗口中的总谱权重趋于 <code>Σjwj=2.25</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the spectral density is non-negative; decreasing <code>η</code> narrows and raises peaks; a sufficiently wide integration window approaches the total weight <code>Σjwj=2.25</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong><code>η</code> 在这里是解析/绘图展宽，不代表真实 many-body self-energy 或 lifetime。DOS peak 也不自动证明 quasiparticle、exciton 或实验峰身份。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> <code>η</code> is analytic/plotting broadening, not a physical many-body self-energy or lifetime. A DOS peak does not identify a quasiparticle, exciton, or experimental feature by itself.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import {
    integrateSpectralDensity,
    spectralDensity,
  } from '../../../data/part07/responseGreenModel.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-green-explorer]').forEach((root) => {
    const broadeningInput = root.querySelector('[data-green-broadening]');
    const energyInput = root.querySelector('[data-green-energy]');
    const broadeningOutput = root.querySelector('[data-green-broadening-output]');
    const energyOutput = root.querySelector('[data-green-energy-output]');
    const densityOutput = root.querySelector('[data-green-density]');
    const integralOutput = root.querySelector('[data-green-integral]');
    const path = root.querySelector('[data-green-path]');
    const probe = root.querySelector('[data-green-probe]');
    if (!(broadeningInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(energyInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;

    const levels = [-0.9, 0.15, 1.0];
    const weights = [0.7, 1.0, 0.55];
    const minEnergy = -1.8;
    const maxEnergy = 1.8;
    const left = 58;
    const right = 620;
    const top = 36;
    const bottom = 250;
    const xMap = (energy) => left + (right - left) * (energy - minEnergy) / (maxEnergy - minEnergy);
    const yMap = (value) => bottom - value * (bottom - top) / 4.8;

    const update = () => {
      const broadening = Number(broadeningInput.value);
      const energy = Number(energyInput.value);
      const curve = Array.from({ length: 361 }, (_, index) => {
        const sampleEnergy = minEnergy + (maxEnergy - minEnergy) * index / 360;
        return {
          energy: sampleEnergy,
          value: spectralDensity({ energy: sampleEnergy, broadening, levels, weights }),
        };
      }).map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xMap(point.energy).toFixed(2)} ${yMap(point.value).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');
      const density = spectralDensity({ energy, broadening, levels, weights });
      const integral = integrateSpectralDensity({
        minEnergy: -8,
        maxEnergy: 8,
        intervals: 30000,
        broadening,
        levels,
        weights,
      });
      if (path instanceof SVGPathElement) path.setAttribute('d', curve);
      if (probe instanceof SVGLineElement) {
        probe.setAttribute('x1', xMap(energy).toFixed(2));
        probe.setAttribute('x2', xMap(energy).toFixed(2));
      }
      if (broadeningOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) broadeningOutput.value = broadening.toFixed(2);
      if (energyOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) energyOutput.value = energy.toFixed(2);
      if (densityOutput instanceof HTMLElement) densityOutput.textContent = density.toFixed(5);
      if (integralOutput instanceof HTMLElement) integralOutput.textContent = integral.toFixed(5);
    };
    broadeningInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    energyInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .green-explorer { overflow-x: auto; }
  .green-explorer svg { width: 100%; min-width: 38rem; }
  .green-explorer text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .green-explorer__pole { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .green-explorer__probe { stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .green-explorer__controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .green-explorer__controls label { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .green-explorer__readout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(10rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.4rem 1rem; }
  .green-explorer__fallback { max-width: 34rem; }
</style>
